There are a few more clothes in front of me.
Next I take a yellow cotton skirt.
This skirt is very nice.
I put on that yellow skirt.
The yellow color is very bright.
That cotton skirt is very soft.
I look in the mirror.
I like this new skirt a lot.
But then I look at its price.
The price is very high.
This skirt is very expensive.
It is too expensive for me.
I feel a little bad.
I take off that big yellow skirt.
I put that skirt aside.
Now I look at the next garment.
